hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"958","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat pahunchi ke Abdullah bin Umar pehli do jamron ke paas lamba wuqoof karte they, Allah ki takbeer kehte, us ki tasbeeh aur hamd bayan karte aur Allah se dua mangte they, aur jamra-e-aqaba ke paas wuqoof na karte they."
"1090","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Ata bin Yasar se riwayat kya ke Banu Haritha ke Ansar mein se aik shakhs Uhud mein apni doodh dene wali oontni chara raha tha, jab use maut aane lagi to us ne use tez dhaar wali lakdi se zibah kar diya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se is ke bare mein pucha gaya to Aap ne farmaya ke is mein koi harj nahi, ise kha lo."
